{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Bolkoy","text":"Amazing, you recovered the orb.","uri":"4f1ab2bf2ce3a2d19ccc552997674e15.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Bolkoy","text":"Anyway, would you like anything from my shop?","uri":"2748c9190c6dd516b03f1b417d511314.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Bolkoy","text":"Hello there. You're that hero who saved the orbs. Soon we will perform the ritual and the village will be safe again.","uri":"35b18fb3b598c872fdadb1fc7465517e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Bolkoy","text":"Oh, hello there. Have you heard? They took the other orbs, it's terrible. I suppose the show must go on.","uri":"167417f41828f4342e121c1048be223d.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Bolkoy","text":"Well I am impressed. Would you like to buy something?","uri":"f989e38e0305bf2a5cc718ff59cb13ff.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Bolkoy","text":"Would you like to buy something?","uri":"1a6f6156a8943f4e9c919bbfc8a9487e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Commander Montai","text":"Do you think you can do it?","uri":"ef5d277169faa8648c1a66dced6871ab.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Commander Montai","text":"Excellent we need all the help we can get.","uri":"e33eecda5357025ae713a02c5742c33d.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Commander Montai","text":"Firstly we need to strengthen our own defences. We desperately need wood to make more battlements, once the battlements are gone it's all over. Six loads of normal logs should do it.","uri":"9c6ee998433f73a3f510de3a269720ea.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Commander Montai","text":"From this distance we can't get an accurate enough shot.  We need the correct coordinates of the stronghold for a direct hit.  I've sent out three tracker gnomes to gather them.","uri":"a3cfaafc1a7161d69e3e33b50f6bd1ef.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Commander Montai","text":"Hello again, we're still desperate for wood soldier.","uri":"5a15ead1ab78b056ab16e7898d5aa43d.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Commander Montai","text":"Hello again, we're still desperate for wood soldier. We need six loads of normal logs.","uri":"ef013a5bb9a0e4e4722b9e26c82ed89c.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Commander Montai","text":"Hello traveller, are you here to help or just to watch?","uri":"92db23e2b0e744df1d665ea655798c60.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Commander Montai","text":"Hello warrior. We need the coordinates for a direct hit from the ballista. Once you have a direct hit you will be able to enter the stronghold and retrieve the orb.","uri":"e6168167f3b042eff8a5e9253cdc916c.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Commander Montai","text":"I don't know how long I will be able to hold out. Once you have the coordinates come back and fire the ballista right into those monsters.","uri":"fbf02054ff9902abba6dacc4818fe849.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Commander Montai","text":"I saw, that was a beautiful sight. The Khazard troops didn't know what hit them.","uri":"a1f2080550faae42aafbfc3978fbbb59.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Commander Montai","text":"I understand, this isn't your fight.","uri":"a8dbdedce0c6c7c077643c14f0b397e8.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Commander Montai","text":"I'll stay here with my troops and try and hold Khazard's men back. You return the orb to the gnome village. Go as quick as you can, the village is still unprotected.","uri":"f71a7182ea0cdcd44533cb8d020ef5f2.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Commander Montai","text":"I'm afraid not, and we're running out of time. I need you to go into the heart of the battlefield, find the trackers, and bring back the coordinates.","uri":"e0eea72a31a2c0a59c8e2121fccc99cd.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Commander Montai","text":"I'm commander Montai. The orb is in the Khazard stronghold to the north, but until we weaken their defences we can't get close.","uri":"c0483c1a29b330daeff07eaf602fb933.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Commander Montai","text":"I'm ok, this battle is going to take longer to win than I expected. The Khazard troops won't give up even without the orb.","uri":"64931d0180ff4ef9d0013ef01df1e10a.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Commander Montai","text":"If you can retrieve the orb and bring safety back to my people, none of the blood spilled on this field will be in vain.","uri":"bde9ab76a3fdd3774f8825d26cac4c50.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Commander Montai","text":"Incredible, for a human you really are something.","uri":"097f0c2e55e9bd0aebeb2747892e5a96.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Commander Montai","text":"Now is the time to retrieve the orb. It's all in your hands. I'll be praying for you.","uri":"d53d4e1463c251cb3d93ed17c3cd7a02.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Commander Montai","text":"Please be as quick as you can, I don't know how much longer we can hold out.","uri":"3dcbc411bc825bf5c08ba7a8d6da5861.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Commander Montai","text":"Thank you, you're braver than most.","uri":"90186a26c1e0a535d5adf1b55ff4d3ab.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Commander Montai","text":"Thank you.","uri":"106f86bf074f2e694896f99ce6491057.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Commander Montai","text":"That's a shame, we could have done with your help.","uri":"ebae2092c0a117ea7da33f459e7f7c21.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Commander Montai","text":"That's excellent, now we can make more defensive battlements.  Give me a moment to organise the troops and then come speak to me. I'll inform you of our next phase of attack.","uri":"7f537b5a9ef59151beb499f5b568400b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Commander Montai","text":"The ballista can break through the stronghold wall, and then we can advance and seize back the orb.","uri":"6cb29d481783ae466179c28d0d7afe67.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Commander Montai","text":"We're hanging in there soldier. For the next phase of our attack we need to breach their stronghold.","uri":"be01752c5a1034f24ccb0896402b9d2f.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Elkoy","text":"Did you hear?","uri":"8a71aab2e2be6fa0677089718082da51.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Elkoy","text":"Good luck friend.","uri":"ca0aedef72d9eec86e2866b5f52e91ee.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Elkoy","text":"Here we are. Despite what has happened here, I hope you feel welcome.","uri":"7dbd1f52d19d8cd14a9d958d4047b16c.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Elkoy","text":"Here we are. Feel free to have a look around.","uri":"0405a44dad813d307b75ff416d11c992.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Elkoy","text":"Here we are. Have a safe journey.","uri":"e6efbac9f934a337d0ae8d1ec184ccdd.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Elkoy","text":"Here we are. Take the orb to King Bolren, I'm sure he'll be pleased to see you.","uri":"e4bee3ce44b96de43e330cb5529380d7.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Elkoy","text":"Khazard's men have pillaged the village! They slaughtered many, and took the other orbs in an attempt to lead us out of the maze. When will the misery end?","uri":"9d2fa1bee9d5ded79d82e93c2f1a4bbe.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Elkoy","text":"Oh my! Oh my!","uri":"4d547d5f154d1403129128fd52442de3.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Elkoy","text":"Ok then, take care.","uri":"adc6a9f7454d47fc9b340b943e34a4f1.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Elkoy","text":"Please help us find the orbs.","uri":"f145b05cc703a0fb9aa06bdb5ded22a6.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Elkoy","text":"Please help us get our orb back.","uri":"6ec13dd630d310b4a6b14a248b1c5dc3.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Elkoy","text":"Please return with our orb soon.","uri":"780d50f9ae3011639580805158ffe665.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Elkoy","text":"Please, we must have the orb if we are to survive.","uri":"a3cffd8f999d20f1ba01a9c6dbb2987a.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Elkoy","text":"Please, we must have the orb if we are to survive. Do you need me to show you through the maze?","uri":"e02b6dcd3d39c1f9965d6ce51117ceef.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Elkoy","text":"Take it to King Bolren, I'm sure he'll be pleased to see you.","uri":"d26fb350ac2bf1db35729141793d6c8c.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Elkoy","text":"The orb, they have the orb. We're doomed. Do you need me to show you back to the village?","uri":"2d164e5a067084da22ee75a609693aa7.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Elkoy","text":"The orb, they have the orb. We're doomed. Do you need me to show you through the maze?","uri":"d4df36a30e1a1434fe42d05748db229b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Elkoy","text":"We're out of the maze now. Please hurry, we must have the orb if we are to survive.","uri":"298cf9aaa5a5a6df8befe3e8805c8d46.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Elkoy","text":"Would you like me to show you the way to the village?","uri":"11b8b0f60f471c732f80b0b1be57be77.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Elkoy","text":"You must retrieve the orb, or the gnome village is doomed. Do you need me to show you through the maze?","uri":"ca70a425984f23d7ad52477226eab273.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Elkoy","text":"You saved us by returning the orbs of protection. I'm humbled and wish you well.","uri":"d528b6a2ef4d68b614e0cdd28276c2ff.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Elkoy","text":"You saved us by returning the orbs of protection. I'm humbled and wish you well. Would you like me to show you through the maze?","uri":"090514ad2039c9ef3d49293d7a306a8a.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Elkoy","text":"You truly are a hero.","uri":"6e32db63b2cf113273e433c8215ec42a.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Elkoy","text":"You're back! And the orb?","uri":"8b86602d6e6c6302709990c819a2dac5.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Elkoy","text":"You're our saviour. Please return it to the village and we are all saved. Would you like me to show you the way to the village?","uri":"c010f7b39c575bc89cffa4d5fdce1143.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Kalron","text":"Hello. I hope they come out and find me soon. It's getting cold.","uri":"759cf9ef8c1fe5dd4ab880fc1dd48a83.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Kalron","text":"Oh my, oh my, the village has been pillaged and I'm still lost. Oh dear.","uri":"42ee691bc47b2a1f4b6e299a860a8ad8.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Kalron","text":"Oh my. I'll never find my way back before Khazard's men come and hunt me down.","uri":"875d63ae96134d41e75e3fa6c74bd359.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Khazard commander","text":"Don't even think of taking the orb!","uri":"c8d0c1c8f4e6f5b686bc2d1efa4d2af7.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Khazard commander","text":"Oi! You! Get out of there.","uri":"2a38a76a2d0e1c1d6f29fa8c3cdad51e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Khazard warlord","text":"Bah, enough of you!","uri":"99cf04a35d7167a430c217b36c4e7227.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Khazard warlord","text":"Don't speak to me you insignificant wretch! Die in the name of Khazard!","uri":"4099d25fe5681d0388d87766e82c7c71.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Khazard warlord","text":"Fool, warriors blessed by Khazard don't die. You can't kill that which is already dead. However I can kill you!","uri":"739d69401ccc3a27ae7166143563fc30.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Khazard warlord","text":"Go back to your pesky little green friends.","uri":"c396ba3f7c53e8b79ef4502ba43a0fe3.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Khazard warlord","text":"Ha, you really think you stand a chance? I'll crush you.","uri":"cdc7affa9f1a63c695486829083f9c2c.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Khazard warlord","text":"I'll crush you and those pesky little green men!","uri":"a84a34c1bc8aafae27b28ca9e71c9982.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Khazard warlord","text":"You think you're so clever. You know nothing!","uri":"df69a9b4dba03236b13c4fcd9fa75070.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Khazard warlord","text":"You're out of your depth traveller. These orbs are part of a much larger picture.","uri":"b7cb6b88cc236270fa52ff1d7714ee28.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"Do you have the orb?","uri":"5445259df54fa120fc1a4099ef9981c1.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"Hello traveller, we must retrieve the orb. It's being held by Khazard troops north of here.","uri":"d5b9508efa6b1113a6377d03197d7d14.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"Hooray, you're amazing. I didn't think it was possible but you've saved us.","uri":"68416c1ea0a9f21cf460f81be52432ee.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"I understand, this isn't your battle.","uri":"be0574b42523336c3caf55babe26cf47.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"I will safeguard this orb and pray for your safe return. My assistant will guide you out.","uri":"c8f824fd78df5623878e9f48f7a7373e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"I'm afraid I have more serious concerns at the moment. Very serious.","uri":"92689cf661954eb1807a8e43cbcc7b88.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"I'm glad you asked.","uri":"68a806f5858f0d4688dffcf7012f08e5.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"I'm surprised you made it in, maybe I made the maze too easy.","uri":"2e9552d5b48b5b278b98f8880a9556f8.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"Khazard troops seized the orb. Now we are completely defenceless.","uri":"085e46598035146c76f81c25bd725683.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"Khazard troops. They slaughtered anyone who got in their way. Women, children, my wife.","uri":"a5952cd282cd68cd767bd92b0b5ed180.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"My assistant shall guide you out. Good luck friend, try your best to return the orb","uri":"18560af1bd7fa158737581ed82c33229.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"Now at last my people are safe once more. We can live in peace again.","uri":"4e94cfd19c2c87d845dcb19e3459a3bb.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"Oh my... The misery, the horror!","uri":"bb3c54078d6b88f33c2e3deddc46d7db.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"Ok then, travel safe.","uri":"034bc98fac5b84970c25530e9b07e61a.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"Ok, take care.","uri":"13979d4165a11fca3ff9d152d058846a.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"Once the orbs are replaced we will be safe once more. We must begin the ceremony immediately.","uri":"da60fd0835dae1d5b52fdfb377c4c535.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"Please, for your efforts take this amulet. It's made from the same sacred stone as the orbs of protection. It will help keep you safe on your journeys.","uri":"91cff4914073355c73397c1ec916c850.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"Please, we must have the orb if we are to survive.","uri":"87d5a1d06136df484b2be1e0f4af6c82.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"Please, we must have the orbs if we are to survive.","uri":"0663badc7875a24384cda980f1d8edfd.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"Thank you traveller, but it's too late. We're all doomed.","uri":"e4e379eff3ec964a1648d86dfede8672.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"Thank you. The battlefield is to the north of the maze. Commander Montai will inform you of their current situation.","uri":"0d31ff09df24381f9e685a6edabf14be.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"That is if he's still alive.","uri":"f84a9e547d8f25a7818aac81285a6e80.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"The orb is being held at the battlefield north of the maze.","uri":"d2e7fe4b9b3101d4151787d620c8b4c8.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"The spirit tree has looked over us for centuries. Now we must pay our respects.","uri":"2412aa056ba190110ff8c6acef9dccc2.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"The tree has many other powers, some of which I cannot reveal. As a friend of the gnome people, I can now allow you to use the tree's magic to teleport to other trees grown from related seeds.","uri":"c909aeb5bd110655c0d113cdaf69da2e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"The truth is my people are in grave danger. We have always been protected by the Spirit Tree. No creature of dark can harm us while its three orbs are in place.","uri":"9fecc7a6d1de80af9e0e3ec7d98d6b7f.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"They came in the night. I don't know how many, but enough.","uri":"c7e6ee155f13aa13f7c3a6043a8d464d.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"They headed north of the stronghold. A warlord carries the orbs.","uri":"4c0db06ec60a4a15c1cafac7e01b53d6.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"They took the other orbs, now we are defenceless.","uri":"7ac1b96018dbf57dfd6fb9ed741ff93c.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"We are not a violent race, but we fight when we must. Many gnomes have fallen battling the dark forces of Khazard to the North.","uri":"8285319acaef1598fd4a06dbe6b4c2d6.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"We became desperate, so we took one orb of protection to the battlefield. It was a foolish move.","uri":"3fa4b57005413d29f78b98fa5fb0d7a5.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"Well hello stranger. My name's Bolren, I'm the king of the tree gnomes.","uri":"40fcaba6ec8da3189617ca72877806a5.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"You are brave, but this task will be tough even for you. I wish you the best of luck. Once again you are our only hope.","uri":"68865895da1031a6dd435f4089c478c4.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"You are modest brave traveller.","uri":"1c9cecd49eb6e37f638a9df997e79aee.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"You made it back! Do you have the orbs?","uri":"e09c688989bae430c3396003f2ede17b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"King Bolren","text":"You would be a huge benefit on the battlefield. If you would go there and try to retrieve the orb, my people and I will be forever grateful.","uri":"40760b0b9bd1507867bb091771af46a3.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Local Gnome","text":"Little man stronger than big man. Hee hee, lardi dee, lardi da.","uri":"930b9df3a0e298bd2dbb407d4c4b0457.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Local Gnome","text":"Must save the orbs and kill the Khazard warlord. That will be fun, hee hee.","uri":"dfa8da0a581dc0e356ef308be0b70173.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Local Gnome","text":"Soon we're gonna have the sacred ceremony and boy am I going to party. Lock up your daughters. Hee hee.","uri":"fd01d522440bc59a31d03ed230cabd91.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Northern Local Gnomes","text":"Su tana.","uri":"2d216296a834bd543e6780d81839ac63.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Player Female","text":"Are you ok?","uri":"16455bd047e56c5a1f8a21459555caef.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Player Female","text":"Are you OK?","uri":"9fb9c3ce0d38eda00def51aa28814e01.mp3"}
{"quest":"Tree Gnome Village","character":"Player Female","text":"Bolren, I have returned.","uri":"eb11d4b831b5fa38941f139cf86a7460.mp3"}
